                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "191a02ee-2da7-3194-bdde-566ae271e701",
                        "entry_id": "642b0c87-f1cc-300d-b7fa-8b4b15901a7d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Spécialiste de phrénologie."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5440a728-e4e3-4d68-b3ae-9c7d5590758c",
                                "sense_id": "191a02ee-2da7-3194-bdde-566ae271e701",
                                "text": "« Ma chère miss Jane, depuis quelques mois j’ai pris la résolution de me marier ; et comme j’ai la prétention d’être bon phrénologue et bon physionomiste, j’ai toujours compté obéir à la première sympathie bien franche et bien vive qu’une belle figure me ferait éprouver. »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89b2f9fd-df35-452e-aea6-5bb11e1d75df",
                                "sense_id": "191a02ee-2da7-3194-bdde-566ae271e701",
                                "text": "On répétait les détails du crime, on se demandait quelles seraient les opinions des phrénologues sur Troppmann."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "26929e33-9775-3761-b7f2-3356ff7f4aa3",
                        "entry_id": "642b0c87-f1cc-300d-b7fa-8b4b15901a7d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Partisan du système phrénologique."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a80d7dd3-5597-4c34-8f79-18a58e9621d3",
                                "sense_id": "26929e33-9775-3761-b7f2-3356ff7f4aa3",
                                "text": "Ô phrénologues ! L’inéducabilité érigée en principe ? quel inhominalisme ! La sublime créature est éducable, voyante et libre, criminelle ou vertueuse à son choix, responsable."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3381c93f-e36c-4e19-9c59-c39c3344b4e6",
                        "source_entry_id": "642b0c87-f1cc-300d-b7fa-8b4b15901a7d",
                        "target_lang_word": "phrenologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "phrenologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "735179fc-c352-3be5-9906-3f746e61c8c9",
                                        "entry_id": "0874ed22-0b3e-3be8-a607-c19b8d7a00f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An adherent or practitioner of phrenology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc57cace-9dac-4544-bbb8-ce698687e6cb",
                                                "sense_id": "735179fc-c352-3be5-9906-3f746e61c8c9",
                                                "text": "The phrenologist, who regulates heart and mind by undulations of the skull, has another system."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51282ec3-4fc8-4e6e-8fe2-752540ff2c58",
                                                "sense_id": "735179fc-c352-3be5-9906-3f746e61c8c9",
                                                "text": "One significance weakness of phrenology in the eyes of most anatomists, as Anne Harrington has shown, was that the brain comprised two structurally identical cerebral hemispheres, separated by a longitudinal fissure, whereas phrenologists held that the material sub-stratum of various mental faculties was located in only one hemisphere, and not its twin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb40735c-c09d-4de3-b306-64a5ca14281b",
                                                "sense_id": "735179fc-c352-3be5-9906-3f746e61c8c9",
                                                "text": "During a skull reading, a phrenologist would measure and carefully feel a person’s head."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1e37646c-2680-43f7-a255-da26e537065d",
